      "writtenOn": "2022-12-12T09:08:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e We just need to update client bits to do this. \n\nIs `UnverifiedDeviceInfo` really device specific then? If it\u0027s not, I don\u0027t think we should change the interface. \n\nIf we only need build fingeprint, and it doesn\u0027t need to be signed, keystore could handle this without the HAL knowing.",
